nformadas y mejorar el producto"],"fr":["Définir des métriques significatives avec le cadre de métriques d''acquisition à revenu","Créer des tableaux de bord personnalisés pour prendre des décisions basées sur les données","Identifier la métrique étoile (North Star Metric) pour mesurer le succès de l''entreprise","Réalisser des expériences et analyser les résultats pour optimiser le produit","Utiliser le cadre de métriques pour prendre des décisions éclairées et améliorer le produit"],"de":["Bedeutungsvolle Metriken mit dem Metrikenrahmen von Akquise zu Umsatz definieren","Benutzerdefinierte Dashboards erstellen, um datengetriebene Entscheidungen zu treffen","Die Leitmetrik (North Star Metric) identifizieren, um den Geschäftserfolg zu messen","Experimente durchführen und Ergebnisse analysieren, um das Produkt zu optimieren","Den Metrikenrahmen verwenden, um informierte Entscheidungen zu treffen und das Produkt zu verbessern"],"pt":["Definição de métricas significativas","Criação de painéis personalizados","Integração com o framework de métricas de aquisição e receita","Identificação do North Star Metric","Análise de indicadores principais de receita"],"ru":["Определение важных метрик","Создание персонализированных панелей","Интеграция с фреймворком метрик приобретения и дохода","Определение метрики North Star","Анализ основных показателей дохода"],"ar":["تعريف مقاييس معنوية","إنشاء لوحات تحكم مخصصة","التكامل مع إطار عمل مقاييس الحصول والإيراد","تحديد مقياس النجم الشمالي","تحليل المؤشرات الرئيسية للإيراد"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use analytics-metrics-kpi","what is analytics-metrics-kpi","analytics-metrics-kpi alternative","analytics-metrics-kpi vs product analytics tools","analytics-metrics-kpi install guide","analytics-metrics-kpi setup tutorial","data-driven decision making with analytics-metrics-kpi","product management with analytics-metrics-kpi","metrics framework for product teams"],"zh":["AI エージェント","Analytics & Metrics KPI","北极星指标","仪表盘构建","数据驱动决策","Acquisition 到 Revenue","产品管理","ROADMAP 计划"],"ja":["AI エージェント","アナリティクス＆メトリクスKPI","北極星メトリクス","ダッシュボード構築","データ駆動の意思決定","Acquisition から Revenue","製品管理","ROADMAP 計画"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","분석 및 메트릭스 KPI","북극성 지표","대시보드 구축","데이터 驱动 의사 결정을 하는","Acquisition 에서 Revenue","제품 관리","ROADMAP 계획"],"es":["analytics-metrics-kpi","Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial","métricas significativas","paneles de control","tomar decisiones basadas en datos","marco de métricas de adquisición a ingresos","métrica estrella","experimentos y análisis de resultados"],"fr":["analytics-metrics-kpi","Outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","métriques significatives","tableaux de bord","prendre des décisions basées sur les données","cadre de métriques d''acquisition à revenu","métrique étoile","expériences et analyse de résultats"],"de":["analytics-metrics-kpi","KI-Tools","bedeutungsvolle Metriken","Dashboards","datengetriebene Entscheidungen treffen","Metrikenrahmen von Akquise zu Umsatz","Leitmetrik","Experimente und Ergebnisanalyse"],"pt":["métricas de análise","plugin de gerenciamento de produtos","roadmap de produtos","modelos de história de usuário","North Star Metric","framework de métricas de aquisição e receita","análise de dados para produtos","métricas significativas para produtos","painéis personalizados para produtos"],"ru":["метрики аналитики","плагин управления продуктом","дорожная карта продукта","шаблоны истории пользователя","Метрика Северной Звезды","фреймворк метрик приобретения и дохода","анализ данных для продуктов","важные метрики для продуктов","персонализированные панели для продуктов"],"ar":["مقاييس التحليل","إضافة إدارة المنتج","خريطة طريق المنتج","نماذج قصة المستخدم","مقياس النجم الشمالي","إطار عمل مقاييس الحصول والإيراد","تحليل البيانات للمنتجات","مقاييس معنوية للمنتجات","لوحات تحكم مخصصة للمنتجات"]}},"owner":"pluginagentmarketplace","repo":"custom-plugin-product-manager","repoPath":"pluginagentmarketplace/custom-plugin-product-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.655Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"analytics-metrics-kpi","description":"Master metrics definition, KPI tracking, dashboarding, A/B testing, and data-driven decision making. Use data to guide product decisions.","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Analytics & Metrics Skill\n\nBecome data-driven. Define meaningful metrics, build dashboards, run experiments, and make decisions based on data, not intuition.\n\n## Metrics Framework (Acquisition → Revenue)\n\n### North Star Metric\n\n**Definition:** One metric that best captures the value your product delivers.\n\n**Characteristics:**\n- Directly tied to business success\n- Driven by product improvements\n- Leading indicator of revenue\n- Understandable to whole company\n\n**Examples:**\n- Slack: Daily Activ","body":"# Analytics & Metrics Skill\n\nBecome data-driven. Define meaningful metrics, build dashboards, run experiments, and make decisions based on data, not intuition.\n\n## Metrics Framework (Acquisition → Revenue)\n\n### North Star Metric\n\n**Definition:** One metric that best captures the value your product delivers.\n\n**Characteristics:**\n- Directly tied to business success\n- Driven by product improvements\n- Leading indicator of revenue\n- Understandable to whole company\n\n**Examples:**\n- Slack: Daily Active Users (DAU)\n- Airbnb: Booked Nights\n- YouTube: Watch Time\n- Uber: Rides Completed\n- Stripe: Payment Volume Processed\n\n### Funnel Metrics (Acquisition)\n\n```\nTotal Visitors: 100,000/month\n↓ 20% conversion\nFree Signups: 20,000\n↓ 10% free-to-paid\nPaid Customers: 2,000\n\nCAC: $50 (marketing + sales spend / customers acquired)\nLTCAC: $100 (all customer acquisition costs)\n```\n\n**Metrics to Track:**\n- **Traffic** - Total visitors to website/app\n- **Signup Rate** - % who sign up (target: 10-15%)\n- **Free-to-Paid Conversion** - % free users who pay (target: 2-5%)\n- **CAC** - Cost per acquired customer\n- **CAC Payback** - Months to recover CAC from revenue (target: < 12 months)\n\n### Activation Metrics\n\n**Goal:** New users become active users\n\n```\nFree Signups: 2,000\n↓ 30% onboard successfully\nActivated: 600\n↓ 60% remain active Day 7\nDay 7 Active: 360\n```\n\n**Metrics to Track:**\n- **Onboarding Completion Rate** - % who complete setup (target: 50-80%)\n- **Time to First Value** - Hours to first successful use\n- **Feature Adoption** - % who try key features\n- **Day 1/7/30 Retention** - % active those days (target: 40/25/15)\n\n### Engagement Metrics\n\n**Goal:** Users regularly use product\n\n**Daily/Monthly Metrics:**\n- **DAU/MAU** - Daily/Monthly Active Users\n- **DAU/MAU Ratio** - Stickiness (target: 20-30%)\n- **Feature Usage** - % using key features\n- **Session Length** - Minutes per session\n- **Session Frequency** - Times per week\n\n**Cohort Analysis Example:**\n```\nJan Cohort (1,000 signups):\n- Day 1: 600 active (60%)\n- Day 7: 360 active (36%)\n- Day 30: 180 active (18%)\n- Month 3: 90 active (9%)\n\nFeb Cohort (1,500 signups):\n- Day 1: 1050 active (70%) ← Improving!\n- Day 7: 630 active (42%)\n- Day 30: 300 active (20%)\n```\n\n### Retention Metrics\n\n**Goal:** Users stay and continue paying\n\n```\nMonth 1: 1,000 customers\nMonth 2: 900 active (90% retained)\nMonth 3: 810 active (90% of month 2)\nMonth 12: 314 active (31% annual retention)\n```\n\n**Churn Rate:** % lost each period\n- Monthly churn: (Customers Lost / Month Start) × 100\n- Annual churn: 1 - (Ending / Starting)\n- Target for SaaS: < 5% monthly churn\n\n**NPS (Net Promoter Score)**\n- Question: \"How likely to recommend (0-10)?\"\n- Score = % Promoters (9-10) - % Detractors (0-6)\n- Range: -100 to +100\n- Target: 50+ (world-class)\n\n### Revenue Metrics\n\n**Monthly Recurring Revenue (MRR)**\n```\nMRR = (Total paid customers) × (average subscription price)\nGrowth MRR = New MRR + Expansion MRR - Churn MRR\n```\n\n**Annual Run Rate (ARR)**\n```\nARR = MRR × 12\n```\n\n**Average Revenue Per User (ARPU)**\n```\nARPU = MRR / Total Users\n```\n\n**Customer Lifetime Value (LTV)**\n```\nLTV = (ARPU × Gross Margin %) / Monthly Churn %\n\nExample:\nARPU: $100\nGross Margin: 80%\nMonthly Churn: 5%\nLTV = ($100 × 80%) / 5% = $1,600\n\nIf CAC = $400: LTV/CAC = 4x ✓ (target: 3x+)\n```\n\n## Dashboard Architecture\n\n### Executive Dashboard (C-Level)\n\n**Weekly Updates:**\n- MRR / ARR (vs target, vs month ago)\n- New customers (weekly, monthly)\n- Churn rate (%)\n- NPS score\n- Engagement (DAU, MAU)\n- Key initiatives status\n\n**Frequency:** Weekly\n\n### Product Dashboard (Product Team)\n\n**Daily/Weekly:**\n- Funnel metrics (signup → paid)\n- Feature adoption\n- Engagement metrics\n- User feedback score\n- A/B test results\n- Support ticket volume\n\n**Frequency:** Daily updates\n\n### Financial Dashboard (Finance/Operations)\n\n**Monthly:**\n- MRR / ARR\n- Customer acquisition cost\n- Customer lifetime value\n- Gross margin\n- CAC payback period\n- Revenue by segment\n- Churn by cohort\n\n**Frequency:** Monthly\n\n### Health Dashboard (Operations)\n\n**Realtime:**\n- System uptime (%)\n- Error rate (%)\n- Response time (p95)\n- Database performance\n- Support ticket response time\n- Support backlog\n\n**Frequency:** Realtime/hourly\n\n## A/B Testing (Experimentation)\n\n### Test Planning\n\n**Hypothesis:**\n\"If we change X, then Y will improve, because Z\"\n\n**Example:**\n\"If we move signup button above the fold, then conversion will improve 15%, because users won''t scroll.\"\n\n### Test Structure\n\n**Experiment Design:**\n- **Control:** Keep current version\n- **Treatment:** New version\n- **Sample size:** Enough users to be statistical\n- **Duration:** 2-4 weeks minimum\n- **Metric:** Clear success metric\n\n### Statistical Significance\n\n**Confidence Level:** 95% (industry standard)\n- Means 5% chance of false positive\n- Need enough samples (typically 1000-10K per variant)\n- Use calculator for exact sample size\n\n**P-Value:** Probability result is random chance\n- P < 0.05: Statistically significant\n- P > 0.05: Not significant, inconclusive\n\n### Example A/B Test\n\n**Hypothesis:** Moving signup button above fold increases conversion 15%\n\n**Setup:**\n- Control: Current design\n- Treatment: Button moved above fold\n- Success metric: Conversion rate (signup / visit)\n- Sample size: 10,000 users per variant\n- Duration: 2 weeks\n- Confidence: 95%\n\n**Results:**\n- Control: 2.0% conversion (200 signups from 10K visitors)\n- Treatment: 2.8% conversion (280 signups from 10K visitors)\n- Improvement: 40% increase (0.8% / 2% = 40%)\n- P-value: 0.02 (statistically significant!)\n- Decision: **SHIP IT** - Roll out to 100%\n\n### Test Ideas by Priority\n\n**High Priority (Start Here):**\n- Signup flow optimization (biggest funnel)\n- Onboarding experience\n- Pricing page clarity\n- Feature discoverability\n\n**Medium Priority:**\n- UI copy optimization\n- CTA button colors\n- Email subject lines\n- Notification triggers\n\n**Low Priority:**\n- Micro-copy tweaks\n- Animation effects\n- Color scheme changes\n\n## Metric Pitfalls to Avoid\n\n### Vanity Metrics\n❌ \"We have 1M page views!\"\n✓ \"We have 50K daily active users, growing 10% monthly\"\n\n### Actionable vs Non-Actionable\n❌ \"User satisfaction increased\" (what changed?)\n✓ \"Onboarding completion rate 65% → 78% (↑20%)\" (clear action)\n\n### Correlation vs Causation\n❌ \"Ice cream sales correlate with drownings\"\n✓ Understand actual causation, not just correlation\n\n### Look-Alike Metrics\n❌ Track MRR but not Customer LTV (can grow MRR by spending more on acquisition)\n✓ Track both acquisition efficiency AND retention\n\n## Metrics Review Cadence\n\n**Daily:**\n- System uptime\n- Error rates\n- Support response time\n\n**Weekly:**\n- Funnel metrics\n- Feature adoption\n- Key engagement metrics\n- Test results\n\n**Monthly:**\n- Revenue metrics\n- Cohort analysis\n- Churn breakdown\n- LTV/CAC trends\n\n**Quarterly:**\n- Strategic metric review\n- Long-term trend analysis\n- Metric changes needed\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Yaygın Hatalar & Çözümler\n\n| Hata | Olası Sebep | Çözüm |\n|------|-------------|-------|\n| Vanity metrics focus | Wrong KPI selection | North Star alignment |\n| Inconclusive A/B test | Low sample size | Extend duration |\n| Data inconsistency | Multiple sources | Single source of truth |\n| Dashboard unused | Too complex | Simplify to 5-7 KPIs |\n\n### Debug Checklist\n\n```\n[ ] North Star metric defined mi?\n[ ] Metrics business goals''a aligned mi?\n[ ] Data collection accurate mi?\n[ ] Dashboard refreshed mi?\n[ ] A/B test sample sufficient mi?\n[ ] Statistical significance achieved mi?\n```\n\n### Recovery Procedures\n\n1. **Data Quality Issues** → Flag affected metrics, exclude\n2. **Inconclusive A/B** → Extend test duration\n3. **Misleading Metrics** → Add context/segmentation\n\n---\n\n**Master data-driven decision making and grow faster!**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:57.506Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data-Driven Agents needing advanced analytics and metrics capabilities for informed decision-making.","zh":"非常适合需要高级分析和指标能力的数据驱动型Agent，能够做出明智的决策。","ja":"高度な分析とメトリクス機能を必要とするデータ駆動型エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 분석 및 메트릭스 기능이 필요한 데이터 주도형 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes impulsados por datos que necesitan capacidades de análisis y métricas avanzadas para la toma de decisiones informadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur les données nécessitant des capacités d''analyse et de métriques avancées pour une prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Perfekt für datengetriebene Agenten, die erweiterte Analyse- und Metrikfunktionen für fundierte Entscheidungsfindung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Orientados por Dados que precisam de capacidades avançadas de análise e métricas para tomada de decisões informadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, работающих с данными, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности аналитики и метрик для принятия обоснованных решений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطلعين على البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل البيانات والقيم القياسية لاتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define meaningful metrics, build dashboards, and run experiments using a metrics framework, driving data-driven decisions with North Star Metrics and Acquisition-to-Revenue analysis.","zh":"赋予代理定义有意义的指标，构建仪表盘，并使用指标框架运行实验，驱动数据驱动型决策，使用North Star Metrics和Acquisition-to-Revenue分析。","ja":"エージェントが有意義なメトリクスを定義し、ダッシュボードを構築し、メトリクス・フレームワークを使用して実験を実行することで、データ駆動型の意思決定を促進し、North Star MetricsとAcquisition-to-Revenue分析を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 의미 있는 메트릭스를 정의하고 대시보드를 구축하며 메트릭스 프레임워크를 사용하여 실험을 실행하여 데이터 주도형 의사 결정을 주도하고 North Star Metrics 및 Acquisition-to-Revenue 분석을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir métricas significativas, crear paneles de control y ejecutar experimentos utilizando un marco de métricas, impulsando decisiones basadas en datos con North Star Metrics y análisis de Adquisición a Ingresos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des métriques significatives, de créer des tableaux de bord et d''exécuter des expériences en utilisant un cadre de métriques, impulsant les décisions basées sur les données avec North Star Metrics et l''analyse Acquisition-to-Revenue.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, bedeutungsvolle Metriken zu definieren, Dashboards zu erstellen und Experimente mit einem Metrik-Framework durchzuführen, um datengetriebene Entscheidungen mit North Star Metrics und Acquisition-to-Revenue-Analyse zu treffen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir métricas significativas, construir painéis e executar experimentos usando um framework de métricas, impulsionando decisões baseadas em dados com Métricas Estrela do Norte e análise de Aquisição para Receita.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять значимые метрики, создавать панели и запускать эксперименты с использованием метрического фреймворка, что стимулирует принятие решений на основе данных с помощью метрик Северной Звезды и анализа Приобретения к Выручке.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تعريف قيم قياسية ملائمة، وبناء لوحات تحكم، وتنفيذ تجارب باستخدام إطار عمل لقيم القياسية، مما يدفع اتخاذ القرارات القائمة على البيانات باستخدام قيم القياسية النجمية الشمالية وتحليل الحصول على الإيرادات."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining North Star Metrics for product success","Building dashboards for data visualization and insights","Running experiments to measure product improvements"],"zh":["为产品成功定义North Star Metrics","构建数据可视化和洞察的仪表盘","运行实验以衡量产品改进"],"ja":["製品の成功のためのNorth Star Metricsの定義","データの視覚化と洞察のためのダッシュボードの構築","製品の改善の測定のための実験の実行"],"ko":["제품 성공을 위한 North Star Metrics 정의","데이터 시각화 및 통찰을 위한 대시보드 구축","제품 개선 측정을 위한 실험 실행"],"es":["Definir North Star Metrics para el éxito del producto","Crear paneles de control para la visualización y la información de datos","Ejecutar experimentos para medir mejoras del producto"],"fr":["Définir les métriques North Star pour la réussite du produit","Créer des tableaux de bord pour la visualisation et les informations de données","Exécuter des expériences pour mesurer les améliorations du produit"],"de":["Definieren von North Star Metrics für den Produkterfolg","Erstellen von Dashboards für die Datenvisualisierung und -einblicke","Durchführen von Experimenten zur Messung von Produktverbesserungen"],"pt":["Definir Métricas Estrela do Norte para o sucesso do produto","Construir painéis para visualização e insights de dados","Executar experimentos para medir melhorias de produto"],"ru":["Определение метрик Северной Звезды для успеха продукта","Создание панелей для визуализации и получения информации из данных","Проведение экспериментов для измерения улучшений продукта"],"ar":["تحديد قيم القياسية النجمية الشمالية لنجاح المنتج","بناء لوحات تحكم للرؤية والاستفادة من البيانات","تنفيذ التجارب لقياس تحسينات المنتج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of business success metrics","Driven by product improvements and revenue indicators"],"zh":["需要了解业务成功的指标","受产品改进和收入指标的驱动"],"ja":["ビジネスの成功の指標の理解が必要","製品の改善と収益の指標によって推進される"],"ko":["비즈니스 성공 메트릭스의 이해가 필요","제품 개선 및 수익 지표에 의해 주도됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de las métricas de éxito empresarial","Impulsado por mejoras de producto e indicadores de ingresos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des métriques de succès commercial","Axé sur les améliorations de produit et les indicateurs de revenu"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der Geschäftserfolgsmetriken","Getrieben von Produktverbesserungen und Umsatzindikatoren"],"pt":["Exige compreensão das métricas de sucesso empresarial","Impulsionado por melhorias de produto e indicadores de receita"],"ru":["Требует понимания метрик бизнес-успеха","Обусловлено улучшениями продукта и показателями выручки"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لمقاييس نجاح الأعمال","يتم تشغيله بواسطة تحسينات المنتج ومؤشرات الإيرادات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4f37ea86c1282beef01260ebbd78c23c27028a5d70940ab760da4703557488a7","qualityScore":41}');
