сти","ar":"lobsidian: أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمساءلة","en":"lobsidian"},"description":{"zh":"lobsidian 为 AI 代理提供结构化问责和简单的 markdown 协议","ja":"lobsidian は AI エージェントに構造化された説明責任とシンプルな markdown プロトコルを提供","ko":"lobsidian은 AI 에이전트에 구조화된 책임과 단순한 markdown 프로토콜을 제공","es":"Lobisidian es un protocolo de markdown para motivos, decisiones y tareas de agentes de IA, que proporciona responsabilidad estructurada para herramientas de AI.","fr":"Lobisidian est un protocole markdown pour les motifs, les décisions et les tâches des agents d''IA, qui offre une responsabilité structurée pour les outils d''IA.","de":"Lobisidian ist ein Markdown-Protokoll für Motive, Entscheidungen und Aufgaben von KI-Agents, das strukturierte Verantwortung für AI-Tools bietet.","pt":"O Lobsidian é uma ferramenta de conta AI que fornece responsabilidade estruturada para agentes de IA com protocolo de marcação em markdown.","ru":"Lobsidian - это инструмент ИИ Агентов, обеспечивающий структурированную отчетность с помощью протокола markdown.","ar":"لوبسيديان هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تقدم مساءلة منظمة للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي ببروتوكول markdown","en":"Structured accountability for AI agents. Plain markdown protocol for motives, decisions, and tasks."},"definition":{"en":"Structured accountability for AI agents. Plain markdown protocol for motives, decisions, and tasks."},"features":{"zh":["结构化问责","简单的 markdown 协议","AI 代理决策支持","任务管理","CLI集成"],"ja":["構造化された説明責任","シンプルな markdown プロトコル","AI エージェントの意思決定サポート","タスク管理","CLI 統合"],"ko":["구조화된 책임","단순한 markdown 프로토콜","AI 에이전트 의사 결정 지원","작업 관리","CLI 통합"],"es":["Protocolo de markdown para motivos y decisiones de agentes de IA","Estructura para tareas y responsabilidades de herramientas de AI","Mejora la responsabilidad estructurada para agentes de IA","Facilita la creación de documentos de motivos y decisiones","Permite la integración con herramientas de desarrollo de AI"],"fr":["Protocole markdown pour les motifs et les décisions des agents d''IA","Structure pour les tâches et les responsabilités des outils d''IA","Améliore la responsabilité structurée pour les agents d''IA","Facilite la création de documents de motifs et de décisions","Permet l''intégration avec les outils de développement d''IA"],"de":["Markdown-Protokoll für Motive und Entscheidungen von KI-Agents","Struktur für Aufgaben und Verantwortungen von AI-Tools","Verbessert die strukturierte Verantwortung für KI-Agents","Erleichtert die Erstellung von Dokumenten für Motive und Entscheidungen","Ermöglicht die Integration mit AI-Entwicklungs-Tools"],"pt":["Responsabilidade estruturada para agentes de IA","Protocolo de marcação em markdown","Motivos, decisões e tarefas organizados","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de execução"],"ru":["Структурированная отчетность для ИИ Агентов","Протокол markdown для мотивов, решений и задач","Организация мотивов, решений и задач","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких сред выполнения"],"ar":["مساءلة منظمة للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بروتوكول markdown للدوافع والقرارات والمهام","تنظيم الدوافع والقرارات والمهام","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم بيئات التشغيل المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 lobsidian","什么是 AI 代理","lobsidian 替代品","lobsidian 安装","AI 代理工具","lobsidian 文档"],"ja":["lobsidian の使い方","AI エージェントとは","lobsidian の代替","lobsidian のインストール","AI エージェント ツール","lobsidian ドキュメント"],"ko":["lobsidian 사용법","AI 에이전트란","lobsidian 대체","lobsidian 설치","AI 에이전트 도구","lobsidian 문서"],"es":["herramientas de AI","agentes de inteligencia artificial","protocolo de markdown","responsabilidad estructurada","desarrollo de AI","integración de herramientas de AI","guias de instalación de AI","configuración de herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA","agents d''intelligence artificielle","protocole markdown","responsabilité structurée","développement d''IA","intégration d''outils d''IA","guides d''installation d''IA","configuration d''outils d''IA"],"de":["AI-Tools","Künstliche Intelligenz Agenten","Markdown-Protokoll","strukturierte Verantwortung","AI-Entwicklung","Integration von AI-Tools","Installationsanleitungen für AI","Konfiguration von AI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar Lobsidian","o que é Lobsidian","ferramentas de conta AI","Lobsidian vs ferramentas de IA","instalar Lobsidian","guia de configuração do Lobsidian","desenvolvimento de agentes de IA","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de IA"],"ru":["как использовать Lobsidian","что такое Lobsidian","инструменты ИИ Агентов","Lobsidian vs инструменты ИИ","установить Lobsidian","руководство по настройке Lobsidian","разработка ИИ Агентов","инструменты разработки ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام لوبسيديان","ما هو لوبسيديان","أدوات الوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","لوبسيديان مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت لوبسيديان","دليل إعداد لوبسيديان","تطوير الوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"cannuri","repo":"lobsidian","repoPath":"cannuri/lobsidian","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T13:18:49.255Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"lobsidian","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Lobsidian\n\n## Overview\n\nLobsidian is a structured accountability framework built on plain markdown files. Every piece of tracked work follows a chain: a **motive** captures why something needs attention, a **decision** records what to do about it (with a human consent gate before activation), and **tasks** break the decision into concrete deliverables with outcomes and review cycles. All files live in a single vault directory, require no database or server, and remain readable by any text edit","body":"# Lobsidian\n\n## Overview\n\nLobsidian is a structured accountability framework built on plain markdown files. Every piece of tracked work follows a chain: a **motive** captures why something needs attention, a **decision** records what to do about it (with a human consent gate before activation), and **tasks** break the decision into concrete deliverables with outcomes and review cycles. All files live in a single vault directory, require no database or server, and remain readable by any text editor.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Initialize a vault**\n\n   ```bash\n   npx lobsidian init <path> --name \"<project>\" --agent \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n   This creates the folder structure and system files. See [references/installation.md](references/installation.md) for full options.\n\n2. **Load the protocol**\n\n   Read `_lobsidian/AGENT.md` in the vault root. This file contains all conventions for file types, naming, behavioral rules, and the pull system. See [references/protocol.md](references/protocol.md) for the complete protocol.\n\n3. **Verify the vault**\n\n   ```bash\n   npx lobsidian validate <path>\n   ```\n\n   Exit code 0 means valid. See [references/verification.md](references/verification.md) for the 21 checks and auto-repair options.\n\n## Folder Structure\n\n| Folder | Purpose | Naming Convention |\n|--------|---------|-------------------|\n| `Motives/` | Why something needs attention -- problems, opportunities, tensions | `YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md` |\n| `Decisions/` | What to do about a motive -- proposals, active plans, retired outcomes | `YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md` |\n| `Tasks/` | Concrete work items with deliverables and status tracking | `YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md` |\n| `Knowledge/` | Reference material, notes, domain knowledge | `topic-slug.md` |\n| `Journal/` | Chronological logs -- daily, activity, meeting, reflection | `YYYY-MM-DD.md` |\n| `Inbox/` | Unprocessed items awaiting triage | any name |\n| `Archive/` | Completed or retired items, mirrors source folder structure | mirrors source |\n| `_lobsidian/` | System files -- config, agent protocol, domains, dashboard | managed by protocol |\n\nSlugs use lowercase `[a-z0-9-]`, max 60 characters, derived from the title. On collision, append `-2`, `-3`.\n\n## File Types\n\n| Type | Location | Key Fields | Purpose |\n|------|----------|------------|---------|\n| motive | `Motives/` | `status` (open, addressed, obsolete), `situation`, `need`, `source` | Capture why something matters |\n| decision | `Decisions/` | `status` (draft, proposed, active, under-review, superseded, retired), `motive`, `proposal`, `success_criteria`, `review_date` | Record what to do and track consent |\n| task | `Tasks/` | `status` (pending, claimed, in-progress, blocked, done, cancelled), `assignee`, `priority`, `outcome` | Track concrete deliverables |\n| domain | `_lobsidian/domains/` | `includes`, `excludes`, `wip_limit`, `autonomous_decisions`, `requires_consent` | Define scope and permissions |\n| log | `Journal/` | `subtype` (daily, activity, meeting, reflection), `date` | Record chronological events |\n| note | `Knowledge/` | `title`, `topics`, `confidence` | Store reference material |\n\nAll file types use YAML frontmatter. Every file includes `type`, `created`, `source`, and `created_by` fields. Agent-created content includes a `confidence` field (high, medium, low).\n\n## Consent Gate\n\nDecisions require human approval before activation. The lifecycle:\n\n1. Create the decision with `status: draft` or `status: proposed`\n2. Present the proposal and ask for objections\n3. Wait for explicit human consent\n4. Only after consent: set `status: active` and log the approval with timestamp\n\nAn agent must never set `status: active` on its own decisions. Human consent is also required for file deletion and domain changes.\n\nThis gate ensures accountability -- every active decision has a recorded human approval.\n\n## Pull System\n\nWork is claimed, not assigned by the agent. The pull process:\n\n1. Scan `Tasks/` for files where `status: pending` and `assignee` is empty\n2. Sort by `priority` (lower number = higher priority, default 5)\n3. Claim the highest-priority task within the agent''s domain scope\n4. Set `assignee`, `status: claimed`, and `claimed_at` on the file\n5. On completion, set `status: done`, `outcome`, and `completed_at`\n\nRespect the domain''s `wip_limit` (default 3). Do not claim new tasks while at the limit.\n\nBlocked tasks must surface explicitly. If unable to complete a task, release it with a note in the `log` array explaining why.\n\n## Behavioral Rules\n\nSix rules govern all vault operations:\n\n- **Transparency** -- Log every create, modify, and archive action in the file''s `log` array\n- **Accountability** -- Every task has an assignee; blocked tasks surface explicitly\n- **Empiricism** -- Agent-created content includes `confidence`; claims cite their basis\n- **Effectiveness** -- Verify every new file serves a stated motive; no speculative content\n- **Continuous improvement** -- Check for overdue `review_date` at session start\n- **Consent** -- Agent-created decisions start as draft or proposed; human approval activates them\n\n## References\n\nDetailed reference material for specific topics:\n\n| Topic | File | Use When |\n|-------|------|----------|\n| Full agent protocol | [references/protocol.md](references/protocol.md) | Loading all vault conventions, file type specs, and behavioral rules |\n| Installation guide | [references/installation.md](references/installation.md) | Setting up a new vault, integrating with agents, container deployment |\n| Validation guide | [references/verification.md](references/verification.md) | Running the 21-check validator, interpreting errors, auto-repair |\n\n## Procedures\n\nContext-triggered procedures for specific situations. Load on demand:\n\n| Trigger | Procedure | File |\n|---------|-----------|------|\n| A user mentions a problem or goal | Facilitation flow -- surface motive, form decision, break into tasks | [examples/facilitation.md](examples/facilitation.md) |\n| A decision''s `review_date` is reached | Review cycle -- present outcomes, seek feedback, advance or retire | [examples/review-cycle.md](examples/review-cycle.md) |\n| Obsoleting a parent motive | Cascade with confirmation -- inventory impact, disposition children, archive | [examples/cascade.md](examples/cascade.md) |\n| Initial vault setup or onboarding | Context extraction -- paste text, extract candidate motives, bootstrap vault | [examples/context-extraction.md](examples/context-extraction.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T15:44:08.675Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Analysis Agents needing structured accountability and plain markdown protocol for motives, decisions, and tasks.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化问责和纯 markdown 协议的分析代理，用于记录动机、决策和任务。","ja":"分析エージェントが構造化された説明責任と動機、意思決定、タスクのためのプレーンマークダウンプロトコルを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 설명책임과 동기, 의사결정, 작업을 위한 평면 마크다운 프로토콜이 필요한 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis que necesitan rendición de cuentas estructurada y protocolo de markdown plano para motivos, decisiones y tareas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse ayant besoin d''une responsabilité structurée et d''un protocole markdown plat pour les motivations, les décisions et les tâches.","de":"Perfekt für Analyseagenten, die eine strukturierte Rechenschaftspflicht und ein plaines Markdown-Protokoll für Motive, Entscheidungen und Aufgaben benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise que necessitam de responsabilidade estruturada e protocolo de markdown simples para motivos, decisões e tarefas.","ru":"Идеально для аналитических агентов, которым требуется структурированная подотчетность и простой протокол markdown для мотивов, решений и задач.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحليل الذي يحتاج إلى مساءلة منظمة وبروتوكول markdown بسيط للأسباب والقرارات والمهام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track work using a chain of motives, decisions, and tasks, all stored in plain markdown files, providing schema introspection and query validation using protocols like Markdown.","zh":"赋予代理跟踪工作的能力，使用动机、决策和任务的链式存储在纯 markdown 文件中，提供使用 Markdown 等协议的模式自省和查询验证。","ja":"エージェントが動機、意思決定、タスクの連鎖を使用して作業を追跡する機能を提供し、プレーンマークダウンファイルにすべてを格納し、Markdown などのプロトコルを使用したスキーマの自己検査とクエリの検証を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 동기, 의사결정, 작업의 연쇄를 사용하여 작업을 추적할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 모든 것을 평면 마크다운 파일에 저장하고, Markdown 등의 프로토콜을 사용한 스키마의 자기검사와 쿼리 검증을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un seguimiento del trabajo utilizando una cadena de motivos, decisiones y tareas, todas almacenadas en archivos markdown planos, proporcionando introspección de esquema y validación de consultas utilizando protocolos como Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre leur travail en utilisant une chaîne de motivations, de décisions et de tâches, toutes stockées dans des fichiers markdown plats, fournissant une introspection de schéma et une validation de requêtes en utilisant des protocoles comme Markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Arbeit mithilfe einer Kette von Motiven, Entscheidungen und Aufgaben zu verfolgen, alle in plainen Markdown-Dateien gespeichert, und bietet Schemaintrospektion und Abfragevalidierung unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Markdown.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acompanhar o trabalho usando uma cadeia de motivos, decisões e tarefas, todos armazenados em arquivos markdown simples, fornecendo introspecção de esquema e validação de consulta usando protocolos como Markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отслеживать работу с помощью цепочки мотивов, решений и задач, все хранятся в простых файлах markdown, обеспечивая интроспекцию схемы и валидацию запроса с использованием протоколов типа Markdown.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تتبع العمل باستخدام سلسلة من الأسباب والقرارات والمهام، كلها مخزنة في ملفات markdown بسيطة، وتوفر استعلام مخطط وفحص استعلام باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating decision tracking","Generating task lists from motives","Debugging decision-making processes using plain markdown files"],"zh":["自动化决策跟踪","从动机生成任务列表","使用纯 markdown 文件调试决策过程"],"ja":["意思決定追跡の自動化","動機からタスクリストを生成する","プレーンマークダウンファイルを使用した意思決定プロセスのデバッグ"],"ko":["의사결정 추적의 자동화","동기에서 작업 목록을 생성하는","평면 마크다운 파일을 사용한 의사결정 프로세스의 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización del seguimiento de decisiones","Generación de listas de tareas a partir de motivos","Depuración de procesos de toma de decisiones utilizando archivos markdown planos"],"fr":["Automatisation du suivi des décisions","Génération de listes de tâches à partir de motivations","Débogage des processus de prise de décision en utilisant des fichiers markdown plats"],"de":["Automatisierung der Entscheidungsverfolgung","Erstellung von Aufgabenlisten aus Motiven","Fehlerbehebung bei Entscheidungsprozessen unter Verwendung von plainen Markdown-Dateien"],"pt":["Automatizar o rastreamento de decisões","Gerar listas de tarefas a partir de motivos","Depurar processos de tomada de decisão usando arquivos markdown simples"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отслеживание решений","Генерировать списки задач из мотивов","Отладить процессы принятия решений с использованием простых файлов markdown"],"ar":["توسيع تتبع القرارات","توليد قوائم المهام من الأسباب","تصحيح أخطاء عمليات اتخاذ القرارات باستخدام ملفات markdown بسيطة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires single vault directory for all files","No database or server needed","Limited to plain markdown files"],"zh":["需要单个保险库目录来存储所有文件","不需要数据库或服务器","仅限于纯 markdown 文件"],"ja":["すべてのファイルを格納するための単一のボルトディレクトリが必要","データベースやサーバーは必要ない","プレーンマークダウンファイルのみに限定される"],"ko":["모든 파일을 저장하기 위한 단일 보관소 디렉토리가 필요","데이터베이스나 서버가 필요하지 않음","평면 마크다운 파일만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un directorio de bóveda único para todos los archivos","No se necesita base de datos ni servidor","Limitado a archivos markdown planos"],"fr":["Nécessite un répertoire de coffre unique pour tous les fichiers","Aucune base de données ni serveur n''est nécessaire","Limité aux fichiers markdown plats"],"de":["Benötigt ein einziges Vault-Verzeichnis für alle Dateien","Keine Datenbank oder Server erforderlich","Begrenzt auf plain Markdown-Dateien"],"pt":["Requer um diretório de cofre único para todos os arquivos","Nenhum banco de dados ou servidor necessário","Limitado a arquivos markdown simples"],"ru":["Требует единой директории хранилища для всех файлов","Не требуется база данных или сервер","Ограничен простыми файлами markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب مجلد خزنة واحد لجميع الملفات","لا يحتاج قاعدة بيانات أو خادم","محدود بملفات markdown بسيطة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b06d924ac6553605a0c2411ffe4e414b3281780a06310e6f08b32c0c8f79dfda","qualityScore":41}');
