@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*包到最新版本","ja":"OpenTelemetry Instrumentationsアップグレードとは、@opentelemetry/instrumentationと@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*パッケージを最新バージョンに更新すること","ko":"OpenTelemetry Instrumentations 업그레이드는 @opentelemetry/instrumentation과 @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* 패키지를 최신 버전으로 업데이트하는 것을 의미합니다","es":"El upgrade-otel es una guía para actualizar las instrumentaciones de OpenTelemetry, incluyendo @opentelemetry/instrumentation y paquetes relacionados","fr":"Le upgrade-otel est un guide pour mettre à niveau les instrumentations OpenTelemetry, notamment @opentelemetry/instrumentation et packages associés","de":"Der upgrade-otel ist ein Leitfaden zur Aktualisierung von OpenTelemetry-Instrumentierungen, einschließlich @opentelemetry/instrumentation und verwandter Pakete","pt":"O que é upgrade-otel? É uma ferramenta para atualizar o OpenTelemetry sem alterações disruptivas.","ru":"Что такое upgrade-otel? Это инструмент для обновления OpenTelemetry без сбоев.","ar":"ما هو ترقية OpenTelemetry? هو أداة لترقية OpenTelemetry بدون تغييرات كسر."},"features":{"en":["Upgrades @opentelemetry/instrumentation to the latest version","Supports upgrading all @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* packages","Checks changelogs for each package, including @opentelemetry/opentelemetry-js and @opentelemetry/opentelemetry-js-contrib","Ensures all upgrades are free of breaking changes","Follows a specific upgrade order for packages, including packages/**","Provides access to changelogs for verification, such as https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/blob/main/experimental/CHANGELOG.md"],"zh":["升级@opentelemetry/instrumentation到最新版本","升级@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*包到最新版本","检查changelog以确保无breaking changes","支持JavaScript和Node.js","兼容React、Angular、Vue.js等框架"],"ja":["最新バージョンの@opentelemetry/instrumentationにアップグレード","最新バージョンの@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*パッケージにアップグレード","changelogを確認してbreaking changesのないことを確認","JavaScriptとNode.jsをサポート","React、Angular、Vue.jsなどのフレームワークと互換性がある"],"k