rumentations","upgrade-otel alternative","OpenTelemetry instrumentation upgrade guide","upgrade-otel setup tutorial","what is upgrade-otel","upgrade-otel vs OpenTelemetry","upgrade-otel install","upgrade-otel for JavaScript applications","OpenTelemetry upgrade best practices"],"zh":["OpenTelemetry Instrumentations升级","升级@opentelemetry/instrumentation","JavaScript升级","Node.js升级","React升级","Angular升级","Vue.js升级"],"ja":["OpenTelemetry Instrumentationsアップグレード","アップグレード@opentelemetry/instrumentation","JavaScriptアップグレード","Node.jsアップグレード","Reactアップグレード","Angularアップグレード","Vue.jsアップグレード"],"ko":["OpenTelemetry Instrumentations 업그레이드","업그레이드 @opentelemetry/instrumentation","JavaScript 업그레이드","Node.js 업그레이드","React 업그레이드","Angular 업그레이드","Vue.js 업그레이드"],"es":["upgrade-otel","OpenTelemetry","instrumentaciones","actualización","Sentry","JavaScript","React","Angular","Vue","guía de actualización"],"fr":["upgrade-otel","OpenTelemetry","instrumentations","mise à niveau","Sentry","JavaScript","React","Angular","Vue","guide de mise à niveau"],"de":["upgrade-otel","OpenTelemetry","Instrumentierungen","Aktualisierung","Sentry","JavaScript","React","Angular","Vue","Aktualisierungsleitfaden"],"pt":["upgrade-otel","OpenTelemetry","atualização","JavaScript","Node","Sentry","instrumentação","logs de alterações","melhores práticas"],"ru":["upgrade-otel","OpenTelemetry","обновление","JavaScript","Node","Sentry","инструментация","журналы изменений","лучшие практики"],"ar":["ترقية OpenTelemetry","OpenTelemetry","ترقية","JavaScript","Node","Sentry","أدوات","سجلات التغييرات","أفضل الممارسات"]}},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"sentry-javascript","repoPath":"getsentry/sentry-javascript","stars":8596,"forks":1754,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T01:25:16Z","topics":["angular","crash-reporting","ember","error-monitoring","hacktoberfest","javascript","javascript-client","nextjs","node","raven","react","sdk","sentry","sentry-client","tag-production","team-sdk-javascript","team-web-frontend","typescript","vue"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upgrade-otel","description":"Upgrade OpenTelemetry instrumentations across the Sentry JavaScript SDK. Use when bumping OTel instrumentation packages to their latest versions.","bodyPreview":"# Upgrading OpenTelemetry Instrumentations\n\n**All upgrades must be free of breaking changes.** Read each changelog before proceeding.\n\n## 1. `packages/**`\n\nUpgrade in this order:\n\n1. **`@opentelemetry/instrumentation`** to latest. Check changelog: `https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/blob/main/experimental/CHANGELOG.md`\n2. **All `@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*` packages.** Check each changelog: `https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js-contrib/blob/main/packages/instru","body":"# Upgrading OpenTelemetry Instrumentations\n\n**All upgrades must be free of breaking changes.** Read each changelog before proceeding.\n\n## 1. `packages/**`\n\nUpgrade in this order:\n\n1. **`@opentelemetry/instrumentation`** to latest. Check changelog: `https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/blob/main/experimental/CHANGELOG.md`\n2. **All `@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*` packages.** Check each changelog: `https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js-contrib/blob/main/packages/instrumentation-{name}/CHANGELOG.md`\n3. **Third-party instrumentations** (currently `@prisma/instrumentation`). Check their changelogs.\n\n**STOP** if any upgrade introduces breaking changes — fail with the reason.\n\n## 2. `dev-packages/**`\n\n- If an app depends on `@opentelemetry/instrumentation` >= `0.200.x`, upgrade to latest.\n- If an app depends on `@opentelemetry/instrumentation-http` >= `0.200.x`, upgrade to latest.\n\nSame rule: no breaking changes allowed.\n\n## 3. Regenerate lock file\n\n```bash\nyarn install\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:25:07.745Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript Agents needing seamless OpenTelemetry instrumentation upgrades.","zh":"适用于需要无缝升级 OpenTelemetryInstrumentation 的 JavaScript 代理。","ja":"JavaScriptエージェントがOpenTelemetryのインストルメンテーションを無停止でアップグレードする必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"OpenTelemetry 인스트루멘테이션을 무중단으로 업그레이드해야 하는 JavaScript 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de JavaScript que necesitan actualizaciones de instrumentación de OpenTelemetry sin problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents JavaScript nécessitant des mises à jour d''instrumentation OpenTelemetry sans problèmes.","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript-Agents, die eine reibungslose Aktualisierung der OpenTelemetry-Instrumentierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes JavaScript que necessitam de atualizações de instrumentação do OpenTelemetry sem problemas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов JavaScript, которым необходимы беспроблемные обновления инструментирования OpenTelemetry.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء JavaScript الذين يحتاجون إلى ترقيات أدوات OpenTelemetry دون مشاكل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to upgrade OpenTelemetry instrumentations for JavaScript applications without breaking changes, ensuring smooth transitions by checking changelogs for @opentelemetry/instrumentation and @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* packages.","zh":"赋予代理升级JavaScript应用程序的OpenTelemetryInstrumentation的能力，避免破坏性更改，通过检查@opentelemetry/instrumentation和@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*包的变更日志，确保平滑过渡。","ja":"JavaScriptアプリケーションのOpenTelemetryインストルメンテーションをアップグレードするエージェントの能力を付与し、破壊的な変更を回避し、@opentelemetry/instrumentationおよび@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*パッケージの変更ログを確認してスムーズな移行を保証する。","ko":"JavaScript 애플리케이션의 OpenTelemetry 인스트루멘테이션을 업그레이드하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여, 파괴적인 변경을 피하고, @opentelemetry/instrumentation 및 @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* 패키지의 변경 로그를 확인하여 무중단 전환을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes actualizar las instrumentaciones de OpenTelemetry para aplicaciones de JavaScript sin cambios que rompan la compatibilidad, garantizando transiciones suaves al verificar los registros de cambios de los paquetes @opentelemetry/instrumentation y @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour les instrumentations OpenTelemetry pour les applications JavaScript sans changements cassants, en garantissant des transitions en douceur en vérifiant les journaux des modifications des packages @opentelemetry/instrumentation et @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die OpenTelemetry-Instrumentierungen für JavaScript-Anwendungen ohne brechende Änderungen zu aktualisieren, indem sie eine reibungslose Übergabe durch Überprüfung der Änderungsprotokolle der Pakete @opentelemetry/instrumentation und @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* gewährleisten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes atualizem as instrumentações do OpenTelemetry para aplicativos JavaScript sem alterações quebradas, garantindo transições suaves verificando os registros de alterações dos pacotes @opentelemetry/instrumentation e @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обновлять инструментирование OpenTelemetry для приложений JavaScript без сломанных изменений, обеспечивая плавные переходы путем проверки журналов изменений пакетов @opentelemetry/instrumentation и @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحديث أدوات OpenTelemetry لتطبيقات JavaScript بدون تغييرات مكسورة، مما يضمن انتقالات سلسة من خلال التحقق من سجلات التغييرات لحزم @opentelemetry/instrumentation و @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*."},"useCases":{"en":["Upgrading @opentelemetry/instrumentation to the latest version","Checking changelogs for @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* packages","Ensuring breaking-change-free transitions for OpenTelemetry instrumentations"],"zh":["将@opentelemetry/instrumentation升级到最新版本","检查@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*包的变更日志","确保OpenTelemetryInstrumentation的升级无破坏性更改"],"ja":["@opentelemetry/instrumentationを最新バージョンにアップグレードする","@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*パッケージの変更ログを確認する","OpenTelemetryインストルメンテーションのアップグレード時に破壊的な変更がないことを確認する"],"ko":["@opentelemetry/instrumentation을 최신 버전으로 업그레이드하는 것","@opentelemetry/instrumentation-* 패키지의 변경 로그를 확인하는 것","OpenTelemetry 인스트루멘테이션의 업그레이드 시 파괴적인 변경이 없는지 확인하는 것"],"es":["Actualización de @opentelemetry/instrumentation a la última versión","Verificación de los registros de cambios de los paquetes @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*","Garantía de transiciones sin cambios que rompan la compatibilidad para las instrumentaciones de OpenTelemetry"],"fr":["Mise à jour de @opentelemetry/instrumentation vers la dernière version","Vérification des journaux des modifications des packages @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*","Garantie de transitions sans changements cassants pour les instrumentations OpenTelemetry"],"de":["Aktualisierung von @opentelemetry/instrumentation auf die neueste Version","Überprüfung der Änderungsprotokolle der Pakete @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*","Gewährleistung von Übergaben ohne brechende Änderungen für die OpenTelemetry-Instrumentierungen"],"pt":["Atualizar @opentelemetry/instrumentation para a versão mais recente","Verificar os registros de alterações dos pacotes @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*","Garantir transições sem alterações quebradas para instrumentações do OpenTelemetry"],"ru":["Обновить @opentelemetry/instrumentation до последней версии","Проверить журналы изменений пакетов @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*","Обеспечить переходы без сломанных изменений для инструментирования OpenTelemetry"],"ar":["تحديث @opentelemetry/instrumentation إلى الإصدار الأخير","التحقق من سجلات التغييرات لحزم @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*","ضمان انتقالات بدون تغييرات مكسورة لأدوات OpenTelemetry"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to OpenTelemetry GitHub repositories for changelog checks","Limited to JavaScript applications","Manual review of changelogs required before proceeding with upgrades"],"zh":["需要访问OpenTelemetry的GitHub仓库以检查变更日志","仅限于JavaScript应用程序","需要手动审查变更日志后才能继续升级"],"ja":["OpenTelemetryのGitHubリポジトリへのアクセスが必要なため、変更ログをチェックする","JavaScriptアプリケーションに限定される","アップグレードを進める前に変更ログを手動でレビューする必要がある"],"ko":["OpenTelemetry의 GitHub 리포지토리에 접근하여 변경 로그를 확인해야 함","JavaScript 애플리케이션에만 제한됨","업그레이드를 진행하기 전에 변경 로그를 수동으로 검토해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los repositorios de GitHub de OpenTelemetry para la verificación de los registros de cambios","Limitado a aplicaciones de JavaScript","Revisión manual de los registros de cambios requerida antes de proceder con las actualizaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux référentiels GitHub d''OpenTelemetry pour la vérification des journaux des modifications","Limité aux applications JavaScript","Révision manuelle des journaux des modifications requise avant de procéder aux mises à jour"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die OpenTelemetry-GitHub-Repositorys für die Überprüfung der Änderungsprotokolle","Begrenzt auf JavaScript-Anwendungen","Manuelle Überprüfung der Änderungsprotokolle erforderlich, bevor mit den Aktualisierungen fortgefahren wird"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos repositórios do GitHub do OpenTelemetry para verificar os registros de alterações","Limitado a aplicativos JavaScript","Revisão manual dos registros de alterações necessária antes de prosseguir com as atualizações"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиториям GitHub OpenTelemetry для проверки журналов изменений","Ограничен для приложений JavaScript","Требуется ручной обзор журналов изменений перед продолжением обновлений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودعات GitHub الخاصة بـ OpenTelemetry للتحقق من سجلات التغييرات","محدود لتطبيقات JavaScript","التحقق اليدوي من سجلات التغييرات مطلوب قبل المتابعة مع التحديثات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e0d1bfbd5f40ba422b929d5364307fb66a9785aad5e953f5642f561c3e904f1e","qualityScore":40}');
