:"Настройка конфигураций сервисов - это процесс调整 параметров в Golem Cloud для ИИ Агентов","ar":"تعديل إعدادات الخدمة هو عملية تحديث المعلمات في Golem Cloud لبرامج وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Implements configuration structs with Default, Serialize, and Deserialize interfaces","Utilizes Figment via a custom ConfigLoader for configuration management","Serializes configuration defaults to TOML and env-var reference files","Validates configuration in CI for high-reliability and fault-tolerance","Supports durable computing and execution in distributed systems"],"zh":["使用Figment实现配置管理","支持TOML和env-var序列化","配置默认值提供安全的显示","实现可靠的AI代理运行时","支持分布式系统和serverless架构"],"ja":["Figmentを使用した設定管理","TOMLとenv-varのシリアル化をサポート","設定のデフォルト値を安全に表示","信頼性の高いAIエージェントランタイムを実現","分散システムとserverlessアーキテクチャをサポート"],"ko":["Figment를 사용한 설정 관리","TOML과 env-var의 시리얼화를 지원","설정의 기본 값을 안전하게 표시","안정적인 AI 에이전트 런타임을 구현","분산 시스템과 serverless 아키텍처를 지원"],"es":["Utiliza Figment para la configuración de servicios","Serialización de configuraciones con TOML","Validación de configuraciones en CI","Implementación de la interfaz Default para valores predeterminados","Soporte para env-var reference files"],"fr":["Utilisez Figment pour la configuration des services","Sérialisation des configurations avec TOML","Validation des configurations dans CI","Implémentation de l''interface Default pour les valeurs par défaut","Prise en charge des fichiers de référence env-var"],"de":["Verwenden Sie Figment für die Dienstkonfiguration","Serialisierung von Konfigurationen mit TOML","Validierung von Konfigurationen in CI","Implementierung der Default-Schnittstelle für Standardwerte","Unterstützung für env-var-Referenzdateien"],"pt":["Utiliza Figment para carregar configurações","Suporte a serialização TOML","Validação de configurações em CI","Implementação de estruturas de configuração personalizadas","Suporte a referências de variáveis de ambiente","Integração com o modelo de componentes WASM"],"ru":["Использует Figment для загрузки конфигураций","Поддержка сериализации TOML","Валидация конфигураций в CI","Реализация пользовательских конфигурационных структур","Поддержка ссылок на переменные окружения","Интеграция с моделью компонентов WASM для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["يستخدم Figment لتحميل الإعدادات","دعم تسلسلي TOML","تحقق من صحة الإعدادات في CI","تنفيذ هياكل إعدادات مخصصة","دعم المراجع المتغيرات البيئية","تكامل مع نموذج مكونات WASM لبرامج وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use modifying-service-configs","modifying-service-configs setup guide","Golem Cloud configuration management","Figment and TOML configuration","durable computing and fault-tolerance","modifying-service-configs vs traditional configuration methods"],"zh":["AIエージェント开发","服务配置修改","Figment","TOML","AI代理运行时","分布式系统","serverless","Golem Cloud"],"ja":["AIエージェント開発","サービス設定変更","Figment","TOML","AIエージェントランタイム","分散システム","serverless","Golem Cloud"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 개발","서비스 설정 수정","Figment","TOML","AI 에이전트 런타임","분산 시스템","serverless","Golem Cloud"],"es":["AI Agents","configuración de servicios","Golem Cloud","Figment","TOML","CI","desarrollo de aplicaciones","agentes de inteligencia artificial","configuración de servicios de AI"],"fr":["Agents IA","configuration des services","Golem Cloud","Figment","TOML","CI","développement d''applications","agents d''intelligence artificielle","configuration des services d''IA"],"de":["AI-Agents","Dienstkonfiguration","Golem Cloud","Figment","TOML","CI","Anwendungsentwicklung","Künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten","Dienstkonfiguration von AI-Agenten"],"pt":["modificando configurações de serviço","Golem Cloud","Figment","TOML","aplicativos distribuídos","configuração de serviço","validação de configuração","WASM","modelo de componentes"],"ru":["настройка конфигураций сервисов","Golem Cloud","Figment","TOML","распределенные приложения","конфигурация сервиса","валидация конфигурации","WASM","модель компонентов","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["تعديل إعدادات الخدمة","Golem Cloud","Figment","TOML","تطبيقات موزعة","إعدادات الخدمة","تحقق من صحة الإعدادات","WASM","نموذج مكونات","برامج وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"golemcloud","repo":"golem","repoPath":"golemcloud/golem","stars":967,"forks":170,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T18:10:13Z","topics":["agentic","agentic-ai","agentic-runtime","agents","ai","ai-agent-runtime","component-model","distributed-systems","durable-computing","durable-execution","fault-tolerance","high-reliability","serverless","wasi","wasm","wasm-component"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"modifying-service-configs","description":"Modifying service configuration types or defaults. Use when changing config structs, adding config fields, or updating default values for any Golem service.","bodyPreview":"# Modifying Service Configs\n\nGolem services use a configuration system built on [Figment](https://github.com/SergioBenitez/Figment) via a custom `ConfigLoader`. Configuration defaults are serialized to TOML and env-var reference files that are checked into the repository and validated in CI.\n\n## How Configuration Works\n\nEach service has a configuration struct that implements:\n- `Default` — provides default values\n- `Serialize` / `Deserialize` — for TOML and env-var serialization\n- `SafeDisplay`","body":"# Modifying Service Configs\n\nGolem services use a configuration system built on [Figment](https://github.com/SergioBenitez/Figment) via a custom `ConfigLoader`. Configuration defaults are serialized to TOML and env-var reference files that are checked into the repository and validated in CI.\n\n## How Configuration Works\n\nEach service has a configuration struct that implements:\n- `Default` — provides default values\n- `Serialize` / `Deserialize` — for TOML and env-var serialization\n- `SafeDisplay` — for logging without exposing secrets\n\nServices load config by merging (in order): defaults → TOML file → environment variables.\n\n## Service Config Locations\n\n| Service | Config struct | File |\n|---------|--------------|------|\n| Worker Executor | `GolemConfig` | `golem-worker-executor/src/services/golem_config.rs` |\n| Worker Service | `WorkerServiceConfig` | `golem-worker-service/src/config.rs` |\n| Registry Service | `RegistryServiceConfig` | `golem-registry-service/src/config.rs` |\n| Shard Manager | `ShardManagerConfig` | `golem-shard-manager/src/shard_manager_config.rs` |\n| Compilation Service | `ServerConfig` | `golem-component-compilation-service/src/config.rs` |\n\nThe all-in-one `golem` binary has its own merged config that combines multiple service configs.\n\n## Modifying a Config\n\n### Step 1: Edit the config struct\n\nAdd, remove, or modify fields in the appropriate config struct. Update the `Default` implementation if default values change.\n\n### Step 2: Regenerate config files\n\n```shell\ncargo make generate-configs\n```\n\nThis builds the service binaries and runs them with `--dump-config-default-toml` and `--dump-config-default-env-var` flags, producing reference files that reflect the current `Default` implementation.\n\n### Step 3: Verify\n\n```shell\ncargo make build\n```\n\n### Step 4: Check configs match\n\nCI runs `cargo make check-configs` which regenerates configs and diffs them against committed files. If this fails, you forgot to run `cargo make generate-configs`.\n\n## Adding a New Config Field\n\n1. Add the field to the config struct with a `serde` attribute if needed\n2. Set its default value in the `Default` impl\n3. Run `cargo make generate-configs` to update reference files\n4. If the field requires a new environment variable, the env-var mapping is derived automatically from the field path\n\n## Removing a Config Field\n\n1. Remove the field from the struct and `Default` impl\n2. Run `cargo make generate-configs`\n3. Check for any code that references the removed field\n\n## Nested Config Types\n\nMany config structs compose sub-configs (e.g., `GolemConfig` contains `WorkersServiceConfig`, `BlobStoreServiceConfig`, etc.). When modifying a sub-config type that''s shared across services, regenerate configs for all affected services — `cargo make generate-configs` handles this automatically.\n\n## Checklist\n\n1. Config struct modified with appropriate `serde` attributes\n2. `Default` implementation updated\n3. `cargo make generate-configs` run\n4. Generated TOML and env-var files committed\n5. `cargo make build` succeeds\n6. `cargo make check-configs` passes (CI validation)\n7. `cargo make fix` run before PR\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:26:27.315Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing durable computing and fault-tolerance through configurable Golem services using Figment and TOML.","zh":"适用于需要通过可配置的Golem服务、使用Figment和TOML实现耐用计算和容错的AI代理。","ja":"FigmentとTOMLを使用して構成可能なGolemサービスを介した耐久性のあるコンピューティングとフォルトトレランスを必要とするAIエージェントに最適。","ko":"Figment와 TOML을 사용하여 구성 가능한 Golem 서비스를 통해 내구성이 있는 컴퓨팅과 고장 감내성을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan cómputo duradero y tolerancia a fallos a través de servicios de Golem configurables que utilizan Figment y TOML.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''un calcul robuste et d''une tolérance aux pannes via des services Golem configurables utilisant Figment et TOML.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die ein langlebiges Rechnen und eine Fehlertoleranz durch konfigurierbare Golem-Dienste benötigen, die Figment und TOML verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de computação durável e tolerância a falhas por meio de serviços Golem configuráveis usando Figment e TOML.","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, которым необходимы прочные вычисления и отказоустойчивость посредством настраиваемых сервисов Golem с использованием Figment и TOML.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى الحوسبة المتينة والتسامح مع الأخطاء من خلال خدمات Golem القابلة للتهيئة باستخدام Figment وTOML."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure Golem services with durable computing and fault-tolerance, leveraging Figment''s configuration system and TOML serialization for reliable env-var reference and validation in CI, ensuring seamless integration with custom ConfigLoaders.","zh":"赋予代理以配置Golem服务的能力，实现耐用计算和容错，利用Figment的配置系统和TOML序列化，以确保在CI中可靠的环境变量引用和验证，并实现与自定义ConfigLoaders的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがGolemサービスを構成し、耐久性のあるコンピューティングとフォルトトレランスを実現できるようにすることで、Figmentの構成システムとTOMLシリアル化を活用し、CIでの信頼性の高い環境変数参照と検証を保証し、カスタムConfigLoadersとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Golem 서비스를 구성하여 내구성이 있는 컴퓨팅과 고장 감내성을 실현할 수 있도록 하는 것으로, Figment의 구성 시스템과 TOML 직렬화를 활용하여 CI에서 신뢰할 수 있는 환경 변수 참조 및 검증을 보장하고, 사용자 지정 ConfigLoaders와의無縫な統合을實現합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar servicios de Golem con cómputo duradero y tolerancia a fallos, aprovechando el sistema de configuración de Figment y la serialización de TOML para una referencia y validación confiables de variables de entorno en CI, garantizando una integración sin problemas con ConfigLoaders personalizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer des services Golem avec un calcul robuste et une tolérance aux pannes, en exploitant le système de configuration de Figment et la sérialisation TOML pour une référence et une validation fiables des variables d''environnement dans CI, assurant une intégration sans heurts avec des ConfigLoaders personnalisés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Golem-Dienste mit langlebigem Rechnen und Fehlertoleranz zu konfigurieren, indem sie das Konfigurationssystem von Figment und die TOML-Serialisierung für eine zuverlässige Umgebungsvariable-Referenz und -Validierung in CI nutzen, was eine nahtlose Integration mit benutzerdefinierten ConfigLoaders gewährleistet.","pt":"Habilita agentes a configurarem serviços Golem com computação durável e tolerância a falhas, aproveitando o sistema de configuração do Figment e a serialização TOML para referência e validação confiáveis de variáveis de ambiente em CI, garantindo integração perfeita com ConfigLoaders personalizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью настраивать сервисы Golem с прочными вычислениями и отказоустойчивостью, используя систему конфигурации Figment и сериализацию TOML для надежной ссылки и проверки переменных среды в CI, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с пользовательскими ConfigLoaders.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تكوين خدمات Golem مع الحوسبة المتينة والتسامح مع الأخطاء، مستفيدًا من نظام التهيئة في Figment وترميز TOML للحصول على مرجع موثوق به وتصديق لمتغيرات البيئة في CI، وضمان التكامل السلس مع ConfigLoaders المخصصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring service defaults using TOML and env-var reference files","Implementing fault-tolerant computing for AI workflows","Validating configuration structs for Golem services using SafeDisplay and Serialize/Deserialize interfaces"],"zh":["使用TOML和环境变量引用文件配置服务默认值","为AI工作流实现容错计算","使用SafeDisplay和Serialize/Deserialize接口验证Golem服务的配置结构"],"ja":["TOMLと環境変数参照ファイルを使用してサービスデフォルト値を構成する","AIワークフローにフォルトトレランスコンピューティングを実現する","SafeDisplayとSerialize/Deserializeインターフェイスを使用してGolemサービスの構成構造を検証する"],"ko":["TOML과 환경 변수 참조 파일을 사용하여 서비스 기본값을 구성하는 것","AI 워크플로우에 고장 감내성 컴퓨팅을 구현하는 것","SafeDisplay와 Serialize/Deserialize 인터페이스를 사용하여 Golem 서비스의 구성 구조를 검증하는 것"],"es":["Configuración de valores predeterminados del servicio mediante archivos de referencia de TOML y variables de entorno","Implementación de cómputo tolerante a fallos para flujos de trabajo de IA","Validación de estructuras de configuración para servicios de Golem mediante interfaces SafeDisplay y Serialize/Deserialize"],"fr":["Configuration des valeurs par défaut du service à l''aide de fichiers de référence TOML et de variables d''environnement","Mise en œuvre d''un calcul tolérant aux pannes pour les flux de travail IA","Validation des structures de configuration pour les services Golem à l''aide des interfaces SafeDisplay et Serialize/Deserialize"],"de":["Konfiguration von Service-Standardwerten mithilfe von TOML- und Umgebungsvariablen-Referenzdateien","Implementierung fehlertoleranter Rechentechnik für KI-Arbeitsabläufe","Validierung von Konfigurationsstrukturen für Golem-Dienste mithilfe von SafeDisplay- und Serialize/Deserialize-Schnittstellen"],"pt":["Configurando padrões de serviço usando arquivos de referência TOML e env-var","Implementando computação tolerante a falhas para fluxos de trabalho de IA","Validando estruturas de configuração para serviços Golem usando SafeDisplay e interfaces Serialize/Deserialize"],"ru":["Настройка стандартов сервиса с использованием файлов ссылок TOML и env-var","Реализация вычислений с отказоустойчивостью для рабочих процессов ИИ","Проверка структур конфигурации для сервисов Golem с использованием SafeDisplay и интерфейсов Serialize/Deserialize"],"ar":["تكوين إعدادات الخدمة افتراضيًا باستخدام ملفات مرجع TOML وenv-var","تنفيذ الحوسبة المتسامحة مع الأخطاء لتدفقات العمل الذكية","التحقق من هياكل التكوين لخدمات Golem باستخدام SafeDisplay وواجهات Serialize/Deserialize"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Figment and TOML configuration","Golem services and custom ConfigLoader implementation necessary","CI validation setup required for env-var references"],"zh":["需要了解Figment和TOML配置","需要Golem服务和自定义ConfigLoader实现","需要CI验证设置以引用环境变量"],"ja":["FigmentとTOMLの構成に関する知識が必要","GolemサービスとカスタムConfigLoaderの実装が必要","環境変数参照のためのCI検証設定が必要"],"ko":["Figment와 TOML 구성에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","Golem 서비스와 사용자 지정 ConfigLoader 구현이 필요합니다","환경 변수 참조를 위한 CI 검증 설정이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la configuración de Figment y TOML","Se requiere implementación de servicios de Golem y ConfigLoader personalizados","Se requiere configuración de validación de CI para referencias de variables de entorno"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur la configuration de Figment et TOML","Nécessite une mise en œuvre de services Golem et de ConfigLoader personnalisés","Nécessite une configuration de validation CI pour les références de variables d''environnement"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse über die Konfiguration von Figment und TOML","Benötigt eine Implementierung von Golem-Diensten und benutzerdefinierten ConfigLoadern","Benötigt eine 