r":["Modèle Next.js pour SaaS","Code open source et personnalisable","Applications web évolutives et sécurisées","Intégration avec des outils d''IA","Documentation détaillée et support"],"de":["Next.js-Boilerplate für SaaS","Open-Source-Code und anpassbar","Skalierbare und sichere Webanwendungen","Integration mit KI-Tools","Detaillierte Dokumentation und Support"],"pt":["Código aberto e personalizável","Base sólida para aplicativos escaláveis","Integração com React e Node.js","Suporte a CLI","Documentação detalhada"],"ru":["Открытый и настраиваемый код","Прочная основа для масштабируемых приложений","Интеграция с React и Node.js","Поддержка CLI","Дetailed документация"],"ar":["كود مفتوح ويمكن تخصيصه","أساس صلب لتطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع","التكامل مع React و Node.js","دعم CLI","وثائق مفصلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","Next.js SaaS开发模板","开源开发框架","SaaS应用开发","AI智能工具开发","如何使用Next.js开发SaaS应用","Next.js SaaS开发教程","AI智能工具安装","AI智能工具设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Next.js SaaSボイラープレート","オープンソース開発フレームワーク","SaaSアプリケーション開発","AIエージェント開発","Next.jsを使ったSaaSアプリケーション開発方法","Next.js SaaS開発チュートリアル","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Next.js SaaS 보일러プレ이트","오픈소스 개발 프레임워크","SaaS 애플리케이션 개발","AI 에이전트 개발","Next.js를 사용한 SaaS 애플리케이션 개발 방법","Next.js SaaS 개발 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","plantillas de Next.js","SaaS","código abierto","aplicaciones web escalables","integración con herramientas de AI","guía de instalación de Next.js","alternativas a Next.js"],"fr":["outils d''IA","modèles Next.js","SaaS","code open source","applications web évolutives","intégration avec des outils d''IA","guide d''installation de Next.js","alternatives à Next.js"],"de":["KI-Tools","Next.js-Boilerplate","SaaS","Open-Source-Code","skalierbare Webanwendungen","Integration mit KI-Tools","Installationsanleitung für Next.js","Alternativen zu Next.js"],"pt":["como usar Next.js","o que é boilerplate","ferramentas de inteligência artificial","alternativas para React","Next.js vs Gatsby","guia de instalação do Next.js"],"ru":["как использовать Next.js","что такое boilerplate","инструменты искусственного интеллекта","альтернативы для React","Next.js vs Gatsby","руководство по установке Next.js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Next.js","ما هي قوالب مفتوحة المصدر","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديلات لرياكت","نيكست.جس مقابل جاتسبي","دليل تثبيت نيكست.جس"]}},"owner":"revokslab","repo":"ShipFree","repoPath":"revokslab/ShipFree","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.824Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writing-plans","description":"Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code","bodyPreview":"# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled developer, but know almost nothing about our toolset or problem domain. Assume they don''t know good test","body":"# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled developer, but know almost nothing about our toolset or problem domain. Assume they don''t know good test design very well.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the writing-plans skill to create the implementation plan.\"\n\n**Context:** This should be run in a dedicated worktree (created by brainstorming skill).\n\n**Save plans to:** `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<feature-name>.md`\n\n## Bite-Sized Task Granularity\n\n**Each step is one action (2-5 minutes):**\n- \"Write the failing test\" - step\n- \"Run it to make sure it fails\" - step\n- \"Implement the minimal code to make the test pass\" - step\n- \"Run the tests and make sure they pass\" - step\n- \"Commit\" - step\n\n## Plan Document Header\n\n**Every plan MUST start with this header:**\n\n```markdown\n# [Feature Name] Implementation Plan\n\n> **For Claude:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task.\n\n**Goal:** [One sentence describing what this builds]\n\n**Architecture:** [2-3 sentences about approach]\n\n**Tech Stack:** [Key technologies/libraries]\n\n---\n```\n\n## Task Structure\n\n```markdown\n### Task N: [Component Name]\n\n**Files:**\n- Create: `exact/path/to/file.py`\n- Modify: `exact/path/to/existing.py:123-145`\n- Test: `tests/exact/path/to/test.py`\n\n**Step 1: Write the failing test**\n\n```python\ndef test_specific_behavior():\n    result = function(input)\n    assert result == expected\n```\n\n**Step 2: Run test to verify it fails**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: FAIL with \"function not defined\"\n\n**Step 3: Write minimal implementation**\n\n```python\ndef function(input):\n    return expected\n```\n\n**Step 4: Run test to verify it passes**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: PASS\n\n**Step 5: Commit**\n\n```bash\ngit add tests/path/test.py src/path/file.py\ngit commit -m \"feat: add specific feature\"\n```\n```\n\n## Remember\n- Exact file paths always\n- Complete code in plan (not \"add validation\")\n- Exact commands with expected output\n- Reference relevant skills with @ syntax\n- DRY, YAGNI, TDD, frequent commits\n\n## Execution Handoff\n\nAfter saving the plan, offer execution choice:\n\n**\"Plan complete and saved to `docs/plans/<filename>.md`. Two execution options:**\n\n**1. Subagent-Driven (this session)** - I dispatch fresh subagent per task, review between tasks, fast iteration\n\n**2. Parallel Session (separate)** - Open new session with executing-plans, batch execution with checkpoints\n\n**Which approach?\"**\n\n**If Subagent-Driven chosen:**\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development\n- Stay in this session\n- Fresh subagent per task + code review\n\n**If Parallel Session chosen:**\n- Guide them to open new session in worktree\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** New session uses superpowers:executing-plans"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:40:53.728Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Workflow Agents tasked with onboarding engineers and managing complex codebase changes.","zh":"适合用于开发工作流代理，负责工程师入职和管理复杂代码库更改。","ja":"エンジニアのオンボーディングと複雑なコードベースの変更を管理する開発ワークフロー エージェントに適しています。","ko":"개발 워크플로 에이전트에게 적합하며, 엔지니어 온보딩 및 복잡한 코드베이스 변경 관리를 담당합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de flujo de trabajo de desarrollo encargados de incorporar a nuevos ingenieros y gestionar cambios complejos en el código.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de workflow de développement chargés d''intégrer de nouveaux ingénieurs et de gérer des modifications de codebase complexes.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklung-Workflow-Agents, die für die Einarbeitung von Ingenieuren und die Verwaltung komplexer Codebase-Änderungen verantwortlich sind.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Fluxo de Desenvolvimento encarregados de integrar engenheiros e gerenciar alterações complexas no código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов рабочего процесса разработки, ответственных за интеграцию инженеров и управление сложными изменениями кодовой базы.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وكيل Flux التطويرية المكلفين بتسجيل مهندسين وإدارة تغييرات شاملة للقاعدة البرمجية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Generates comprehensive, bite-sized implementation plans following DRY, YAGNI, and TDD principles for Next.js SaaS boilerplates. It provides specific file paths, testing procedures, and documentation requirements for engineers with zero codebase context.","zh":"根据 DRY、YAGNI 和 TDD 原则生成全面、 Bite-sized 的实现计划，用于 Next.js SaaS 模板。它为没有代码库上下文的工程师提供特定的文件路径、测试程序和文档要求。","ja":"DRY、YAGNI、TDD の原則に従って、Next.js SaaS ボイラープレート用の包括的で、サイズの小さい実装計画を生成します。コードベースのコンテキストがないエンジニアのために、特定のファイルパス、テスト手順、およびドキュメント要求を提供します。","ko":"DRY, YAGNI, TDD 원칙에 따라 Next.js SaaS 보일러플레이트에 대한 포괄적이고 구체적인 구현 계획을 생성합니다. 코드베이스 맥락이 없는 엔지니어를 위해 특정 파일 경로, 테스트 절차 및 문서 요구 사항을 제공합니다.","es":"Genera planes de implementación integrales y en porciones pequeñas siguiendo los principios DRY, YAGNI y TDD para plantillas SaaS de Next.js. Proporciona rutas de archivo específicas, procedimientos de prueba y requisitos de documentación para ingenieros con cero contexto de codebase.","fr":"Génère des plans de mise en œuvre complets et en petites parties suivant les principes DRY, YAGNI et TDD pour les modèles SaaS Next.js. Il fournit des chemins de fichiers spécifiques, des procédures de test et des exigences de documentation pour les ingénieurs ayant zéro contexte de codebase.","de":"Erstellt umfassende, portionsweise Implementierungspläne unter Berücksichtigung der Prinzipien DRY, YAGNI und TDD für Next.js-SaaS-Boilerplates. Bietet spezifische Dateipfade, Testverfahren und Dokumentationsanforderungen für Ingenieure mit keiner Codebase-Kenntnis.","pt":"Gera planos de implementação abrangentes e compactos, seguindo os princípios DRY, YAGNI e TDD para caldeiras SaaS Next.js. Fornecer caminhos de arquivo específicos, procedimentos de teste e requisitos de documentação para engenheiros com contexto de código de base zero.","ru":"Генерирует комплексные, компактные планы реализации, следующие принципам DRY, YAGNI и TDD для Next.js SaaS-шаблонов. Он предоставляет конкретные пути файлов, процедуры тестирования и требования к документации для инженеров с нулевым контекстом кодовой базы.","ar":"ينتج خطط تنفيذ شاملة ومتوافرة، تتبع مبادئ DRY و YAGNI و TDD لمصانع SaaS Next.js. يوفر مسارات ملفات محددة، إجراءات اختبار ومتطلبات توثيق للمهندسين الذين لديهم سياق قاعدة شفرة صفر."},"useCases":{"en":["Onboarding new engineers to complex codebases","Breaking down feature implementations into atomic tasks","Documenting testing procedures for unfamiliar systems","Creating commit strategies for incremental development"],"zh":["将新工程师引入复杂代码库","将功能实现分解为原子任务","为不熟悉的系统记录测试程序","为增量开发创建提交策略"],"ja":["新しいエンジニアを複雑なコードベースにオンボーディングする","機能の実装を原子タスクに分解する","不明なシステムのテスト手順を文書化する","増分開発用のコミット戦略を作成する"],"ko":["새로운 엔지니어를 복잡한 코드베이스에 온보딩하는 것","기능 구현을 원자 단위의 작업으로 분해하는 것","알 수 없는 시스템의 테스트 절차를 문서화하는 것","증분 개발을 위한 커밋 전략을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Incorporar a nuevos ingenieros a codebases complejos","Dividir la implementación de características en tareas atómicas","Documentar procedimientos de prueba para sistemas desconocidos","Crear estrategias de compromiso para el desarrollo incremental"],"fr":["Intégrer de nouveaux ingénieurs à des codebases complexes","Diviser la mise en œuvre des fonctionnalités en tâches atomiques","Documenter les procédures de test pour les systèmes inconnus","Créer des stratégies de commit pour le développement incrémental"],"de":["Neue Ingenieure in komplexe Codebases einarbeiten","Die Implementierung von Funktionen in atomare Aufgaben aufteilen","Testverfahren für unbekannte Systeme dokumentieren","Commit-Strategien für inkrementelles Entwicklung erstellen"],"pt":["Integração de novos engenheiros a código de base complexo","Divisão da implementação de recursos em tarefas atômicas","Documentação de procedimentos de teste para sistemas desconhecidos","Criação de estratégias de compromisso para desenvolvimento incremental"],"ru":["Интеграция новых инженеров в сложную кодовую базу","Разбиение реализации функций на атомарные задачи","Документирование процедур тестирования для незнакомых систем","Создание стратегий коммитов для инкрементального развития"],"ar":["دمج مهندسين جدد في قواعد برمجية معقدة","تقسيم تنفيذ الميزات إلى مهام ذرية","توثيق إجراءات الاختبار لأنظمة غير مألوفة","إنشاء استراتيجيات الالتزام بالتطوير المتزايد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Next.js-specific focus","Assumes engineer has questionable testing knowledge","Requires understanding of SaaS boilerplate structure"],"zh":["仅限 Next.js 专注","假设工程师的测试知识值得怀疑","需要了解 SaaS 模板结构"],"ja":["Next.js に特化した焦点","エンジニアのテスト知識が不十分であると仮定","SaaS ボイラープレート構造の理解が必要"],"ko":["Next.js에만 집중하는 것","엔지니어의 테스트 지식이 의심스럽다고 가정","SaaS 보일러플레이트 구조를 이해해야 함"],"es":["Enfoque específico en Next.js","Supone que el ingeniero tiene conocimientos cuestionables de prueba","Requiere comprensión de la estructura de la plantilla SaaS"],"fr":["Focus spécifique sur Next.js","Suppose que l''ingénieur a des connaissances de test discutables","Nécessite une compréhension de la structure de la modèle SaaS"],"de":["Spezifischer Fokus auf Next.js","Geht davon aus, dass der Ingenieur zweifelhafte Testkenntnisse hat","Benötigt Verständnis der SaaS-Boilerplate-Struktur"],"pt":["Foco específico em Next.js","Supõe que o engenheiro tenha conhecimento de teste questionável","Exige compreensão da estrutura da caldeira SaaS"],"ru":["Фокус на Next.js","Предполагает, что у инженера есть сомнительные знания тестирования","Требует понимания структуры SaaS-шаблона"],"ar":["تركيز محدد على Next.js","يفترض أن مهندس لديه معرفة مشكوك فيها بالاختبار","يتطلب فهم هيكل مصنع SaaS"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"53988353ca1cb25d779144c9de8666f5e64ce7fa6fbdd17dc49d07709cd3c04f","qualityScore":40}');
