ender","Análise de bundle com source-map-explorer","Linting com eslint-plugin-react-hooks"],"ru":["DevTools для анализа рендеринга","Debugger для пользовательских хуков","Оптимизация производительности с why-did-you-render","Анализ пакета с source-map-explorer","Linting с eslint-plugin-react-hooks"],"ar":["أدوات التطوير لتحليل العرض","متصفح الأخطاء ل Hooks مخصصة","تحسين الأداء مع why-did-you-render","تحليل الحزمة مع source-map-explorer","Linting مع eslint-plugin-react-hooks"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React","React Tooling","DevTools","Debugger","Performance Optimization","Bundle Optimization","Linting","Strict Mode"],"ja":["React","React ","DevTools","Debugger","Performance","Bundle","Linting","Strict Mode"],"ko":["React","React ","DevTools","Debugger","Performance","Bundle","Linting","Strict Mode"],"es":["React","Tooling","Desarrollo web","Análisis de rendimiento","Depuración","Optimización de bundles"],"fr":["React","Tooling","Développement web","Analyse de performance","Débogage","Optimisation de bundles"],"de":["React","Tooling","Webentwicklung","Leistungsanalyse","Debugging","Bundle-Optimierung"],"pt":["React","Ferramentas React","Otimização de performance","Depuração de projetos","DevTools","Debugger","why-did-you-render","source-map-explorer","eslint-plugin-react-hooks"],"ru":["React","Инструменты React","Оптимизация производительности","Отладка проектов","DevTools","Debugger","why-did-you-render","source-map-explorer","eslint-plugin-react-hooks"],"ar":["ري액ت","أدوات ري액ت","تحسين الأداء","تصحيح مشاكل","أدوات التطوير","متصفح الأخطاء","why-did-you-render","source-map-explorer","eslint-plugin-react-hooks"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"React Tooling","description":"Debugging, build analysis, and ecosystem tools.","bodyPreview":"# React Tooling\n\n## **Priority: P2 (OPTIONAL)**\n\nTools for analysis and debugging.\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n- **DevTools**: Use \"Highlight Updates\" to spot re-renders.\n- **Debugger**: `useDebugValue` for custom hooks.\n- **Performance**: `why-did-you-render` to catch wasted renders.\n- **Bundle**: `source-map-explorer` or `bundle-visualizer`.\n- **Linting**: `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` (Errors) + `react-refresh`.\n- **Strict Mode**: Enable for double-invoke checks (effects/reducers).\n\n## Code","body":"# React Tooling\n\n## **Priority: P2 (OPTIONAL)**\n\nTools for analysis and debugging.\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n- **DevTools**: Use \"Highlight Updates\" to spot re-renders.\n- **Debugger**: `useDebugValue` for custom hooks.\n- **Performance**: `why-did-you-render` to catch wasted renders.\n- **Bundle**: `source-map-explorer` or `bundle-visualizer`.\n- **Linting**: `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` (Errors) + `react-refresh`.\n- **Strict Mode**: Enable for double-invoke checks (effects/reducers).\n\n## Code\n\n```tsx\n// Debugging Hooks\nuseDebugValue(isOnline ? ''Online'' : ''Offline'');\n\n// why-did-you-render\nif (process.env.NODE_ENV === ''development'') {\n  const whyDidYouRender = require(''@welldone-software/why-did-you-render'');\n  whyDidYouRender(React, {\n    trackAllPureComponents: true,\n  });\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:52:32.792Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents focused on optimizing React applications with advanced tooling and debugging capabilities.","zh":"适用于专注于优化React应用程序的前端代理，具有高级工具和调试功能。","ja":"Reactアプリケーションの最適化に焦点を当てたフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。高度なツールとデバッグ機能を備えています。","ko":"React 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 데 중점을 둔 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 고급 도구 및 디버깅 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend centrados en optimizar aplicaciones de React con herramientas avanzadas y capacidades de depuración.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend axés sur l''optimisation des applications React avec des outils avancés et des capacités de débogage.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die auf die Optimierung von React-Anwendungen mit erweiterten Werkzeugen und Debugging-Funktionen ausgerichtet sind.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend focados na otimização de aplicações React com ferramentas avançadas e capacidades de depuração.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, ориентированных на оптимизацию приложений React с помощью продвинутых инструментов и возможностей отладки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم المعني بتحسين تطبيقات React باستخدام أدوات متقدمة وقدرات فحص الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React performance using tools like `why-did-you-render` for catching wasted renders, `source-map-explorer` for bundle analysis, and `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` for strict linting, ensuring efficient and error-free code execution.","zh":"赋予代理优化React性能的能力，使用诸如`why-did-you-render`捕获浪费渲染、`source-map-explorer`进行包分析和`eslint-plugin-react-hooks`进行严格的代码检查等工具，确保代码的高效和无错误执行。","ja":"エージェントにReactのパフォーマンスを最適化する能力を与えます。`why-did-you-render`を使用して不要な再描画をキャッチし、`source-map-explorer`を使用してバンドル分析を実行し、`eslint-plugin-react-hooks`を使用して厳格なリンティングを実行するなど、効率的でエラーのないコード実行を保証します。","ko":"에이전트에 React 성능을 최적화하는 능력을 부여합니다. `why-did-you-render`를 사용하여 쓸모없는 재描画를捕获하고, `source-map-explorer`를 사용하여 번들 분석을 수행하며, `eslint-plugin-react-hooks`를 사용하여 엄격한 린팅을 수행하여 효율적이고 오류가 없는 코드 실행을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar el rendimiento de React utilizando herramientas como `why-did-you-render` para detectar renderizados desperdiciados, `source-map-explorer` para el análisis de paquetes y `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` para una verificación estricta, garantizando una ejecución de código eficiente y sin errores.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances de React en utilisant des outils comme `why-did-you-render` pour détecter les rendus inutiles, `source-map-explorer` pour l''analyse des bundles et `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` pour une vérification stricte, garantissant une exécution de code efficace et sans erreurs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Leistung von React zu optimieren, indem sie Tools wie `why-did-you-render` zur Erkennung von verschwendeten Renderungen, `source-map-explorer` zur Bundle-Analyse und `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` für eine strenge Überprüfung verwenden, um eine effiziente und fehlerfreie Codeausführung sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desempenho do React usando ferramentas como `why-did-you-render` para capturar renderizações desperdiçadas, `source-map-explorer` para análise de pacotes e `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` para linting estrito, garantindo execução de código eficiente e sem erros.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность оптимизировать производительность React с помощью инструментов như `why-did-you-render` для поимки бесполезных рендеров, `source-map-explorer` для анализа пакетов и `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` для строгого линтинга, гарантируя эффективную и безошибочную выполнение кода.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين أداء React باستخدام أدوات مثل `why-did-you-render` للقبض على عمليات التصفح المهدرة، و `source-map-explorer` لتحليل الحزم، و `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` للتحليل المتخفيض، مما يضمن تنفيذ 코드 فعالاً وخاليًا من الأخطاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging re-renders with DevTools'' Highlight Updates","Analyzing bundle sizes with `source-map-explorer` or `bundle-visualizer`","Implementing custom hooks with `useDebugValue` for enhanced debugging"],"zh":["使用DevTools的Highlight Updates调试重新渲染","使用`source-map-explorer`或`bundle-visualizer`分析包大小","使用`useDebugValue`实现自定义钩子以增强调试"],"ja":["DevToolsのHighlight Updatesを使用して再描画をデバッグする","`source-map-explorer`または`bundle-visualizer`を使用してバンドルサイズを分析する","`useDebugValue`を使用してカスタムフックを実装してデバッグを強化する"],"ko":["DevTools의 Highlight Updates를 사용하여 재描画를 디버깅합니다.","`source-map-explorer` 또는 `bundle-visualizer`를 사용하여 번들 크기 분석","`useDebugValue`를 사용하여 사용자 정의 후크를 구현하여 디버깅을 강화합니다."],"es":["Depuración de nuevas renderizaciones con DevTools'' Highlight Updates","Análisis de tamaños de paquetes con `source-map-explorer` o `bundle-visualizer`","Implementación de ganchos personalizados con `useDebugValue` para una depuración mejorada"],"fr":["Débogage des re-rendus avec DevTools'' Highlight Updates","Analyse des tailles de bundles avec `source-map-explorer` ou `bundle-visualizer`","Implémentation de crochets personnalisés avec `useDebugValue` pour un débogage amélioré"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung von Neu-Renderungen mit DevTools'' Highlight Updates","Analyse von Bundle-Größen mit `source-map-explorer` oder `bundle-visualizer`","Implementierung von benutzerdefinierten Hooks mit `useDebugValue` für eine verbesserte Fehlersuche"],"pt":["Depuração de re-renderizações com Highlight Updates do DevTools","Análise de tamanhos de pacotes com `source-map-explorer` ou `bundle-visualizer`","Implementação de ganchos personalizados com `useDebugValue` para depuração aprimorada"],"ru":["Отладка повторных рендеров с помощью Highlight Updates от DevTools","Анализ размеров пакетов с помощью `source-map-explorer` или `bundle-visualizer`","Реализация пользовательских крючков с помощью `useDebugValue` для улучшенной отладки"],"ar":["فحص إعادة التصيير باستخدام أداة DevTools'' Highlight Updates","تحليل أحجام الحزم باستخدام `source-map-explorer` أو `bundle-visualizer`","تطبيق مشابك مخصصة باستخدام `useDebugValue` من أجل فحص محسّن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React framework","Limited to JavaScript ecosystem","Dependent on compatible versions of `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` and `react-refresh`"],"zh":["需要React框架","仅限于JavaScript生态系统","依赖于`eslint-plugin-react-hooks`和`react-refresh`的兼容版本"],"ja":["Reactフレームワークが必要","JavaScriptエコシステムに限定される","`eslint-plugin-react-hooks`と`react-refresh`の互換バージョンに依存する"],"ko":["React 프레임워크가 필요합니다.","JavaScript 생태계에만 국한됩니다.","`eslint-plugin-react-hooks` 및 `react-refresh`의 호환 버전에 종속됩니다."],"es":["Requiere el marco de React","Limitado al ecosistema de JavaScript","Dependiente de versiones compatibles de `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` y `react-refresh`"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework React","Limité à l''écosystème JavaScript","Dépendant de versions compatibles de `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` et `react-refresh`"],"de":["Benötigt das React-Framework","Begrenzt auf das JavaScript-Ökosystem","Abhängig von kompatiblen Versionen von `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` und `react-refresh`"],"pt":["Exige o framework React","Limitado ao ecossistema JavaScript","Dependente de versões compatíveis de `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` e `react-refresh`"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка React","Ограничен экосистемой JavaScript","Зависит от совместимых версий `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` и `react-refresh`"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار عمل React","محدود ببيئة JavaScript","يعتمد على إصدارات متوافقة من `eslint-plugin-react-hooks` و `react-refresh`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0f952b478db30b5062a83a3be3e5952fcff21f8493fda23997ec2877e2eeeb0f","qualityScore":40}');
